      "biography": {
        "value": "<h2>Description</h2><p>Sinspawn are presumably fiends that are formed by outlets of the multitude of pyreflies that composes Sin's physical form. Collectively, the forms of Sinspawn coincide with those of reef-dwelling creatures, such as anemones and jellyfish. - DMLeibfrid</p><h2>Defense</h2><p>AC 14, touch 12, flat-footed 12 (+2 Dex, +2 natural)</p><p>hp 16 [27] (3d8+3)</p><p>Fort +1, Ref +2, Will +5</p><h2>Offense</h2><p>Speed 30 ft., Climb 15 ft.</p><p>Melee Bite +5 (1d4+3 plus poison)</p><p>Space 5 ft.; Reach 5 ft.</p><p>Special Attack Wing Flicker</p><h2>Statistics</h2><p>Str 14, Dex 15, Con 13, Int 2, Wis 14, Cha 5</p><p>Base Atk +2; CMB +4; CMD 16</p><p>Feats Improved Natural Armor, Power Attack</p><p>Skills Swim +5</p><h2>Ecology</h2><p>Organization gang (3-5), crowd (6-12), mob (13+)</p>"
